  ($qb$S07C06Q10$qb$, $qb$S07$qb$, $qb$C06$qb$, $qb$L+MM$qb$, $qb$Investment in knowledge management infrastructure (tools, ownership, process) in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Deliberate and funded — knowledge management is treated as a business capability$qb$, $qb$Moderate — some investment is made but not enough to make it a strategic asset$qb$, $qb$Minimal — knowledge management runs on goodwill without dedicated ownership or budget$qb$, $qb$Non-existent — knowledge management is not resourced$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
