  ($qb$S20C09Q05$qb$, $qb$S20$qb$, $qb$C09$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$The degree to which key investors or funders are aligned with the transformation investment and direction in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Strong — investors are fully supportive and the investment case has been communicated$qb$, $qb$Generally supportive — investors are broadly aligned$qb$, $qb$Mixed — some investors are supportive; others are uncertain about transformation investment$qb$, $qb$Not aligned — investor alignment on transformation has not been adequately managed$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
