  ($qb$S20C09Q09$qb$, $qb$S20$qb$, $qb$C09$qb$, $qb$L+MM$qb$, $qb$The quality of transformation governance (steering committees, decision forums, accountability structures) in your organisation is:$qb$, $qb$Strong — governance structures are in place and effective$qb$, $qb$Generally adequate — basic governance is in place$qb$, $qb$Limited — governance for transformation is insufficient$qb$, $qb$Non-existent — there is no formal governance structure for the transformation$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
